{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth","id":1347081,"title":"What they need to clear up when they do a world atlas (Problems with Aeon's Earth.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-08T12:37:53-08:00","id":1347081,"title":"What they need to clear up when they do a world atlas (Problems with Aeon's Earth.","content":"This is going to be a series of Posts about problems, real or perceived, with the setting of Trinity Aeon. The focus is going to be the geopolitics and similar issues. These will range from unclear maps to illogical aspects of the described behaviors or history of nation states in the setting. The hope is that these problems will all be cleared up in an <b>Atlas of AEON Earth</b>.<br /> <br /> I hope many people will join in and offer the defects they see in order that the authors of the game will correct these problems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T12:48:58-08:00","id":1347085,"title":"","content":"The first set of issues I'd liked cleared up involve the World Map. Example: we're told about Venezuelan Plague lands but the map shows Argentine Plague lands. The map of the FSA could use state and Province border lines, especially as this could help people see which states are no longer anything but post-apocalyptic wastelands. <br /> <br /> Maps of Each continent would be very useful, especially if they offered political details and relative levels of corruption. An example of useful political detail might be clearing up borders. From the colors of my copy of the AEON book's map, it looks like Central America down to Panama is controlled by the FSA. But the text of the book specifies conquests of Mexico and Canada only. The crease in the middle of the book's world map hid vital political details in Europe. In the Caribbean, is Puerto Rico controlled by the FSA or South America? It strikes me that the Caribbean would be a major area of conflict in this world with a bitter North/South struggle to control the area.<br /> <br /> More Later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T16:19:24-08:00","id":1347123,"title":"","content":"I don't really know any of the Trinity folks and don't really have skin in this particular game. But as a game designer who knows a ton of game designers, I can say that your way of conveying this stuff is more likely to just stress writers out than get any changes implemented. Like, it's not pointing out contradictions that's the issue, but the specific language you're using for it. I'm fairly used to being misunderstood for accidentally using the wrong tone and I understand when other people do it, so I'm not trying to be critical here, but just give you a heads up.<br /> <br /> Like, personally, I think there's a lot of issues that came from Trinity 1e being designed in the '90s and Aeon 2e needing to inherit most of that setting to be recognizable. So you get some kinda cringey stereotypes and weird future versions of 1990s countries, even with them being cleaned up somewhat. And it's a huge book with lots of authors, so presumably there's going to be a few contradictions that could be clariied.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1711,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","user":"Zeea","date":". 11-08-2019, 07:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-08T18:21:05-08:00","id":1347151,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1347123#post1347123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't really know any of the Trinity folks and don't really have skin in this particular game. But as a game designer who knows a ton of game designers, I can say that your way of conveying this stuff is more likely to just stress writers out than get any changes implemented. Like, it's not pointing out contradictions that's the issue, but the specific language you're using for it. I'm fairly used to being misunderstood for accidentally using the wrong tone and I understand when other people do it, so I'm not trying to be critical here, but just give you a heads up.<br /> <br /> Like, personally, I think there's a lot of issues that came from Trinity 1e being designed in the '90s and Aeon 2e needing to inherit most of that setting to be recognizable. So you get some kinda cringey stereotypes and weird future versions of 1990s countries, even with them being cleaned up somewhat. And it's a huge book with lots of authors, so presumably there's going to be a few contradictions that could be clariied.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry if my tone is wrong. But I do want to call attention to many serious problems. Confusing maps, weird geopolitical twists, and anvilicious futures aren't small problems. Plus, you haven't made the least suggestion of what might be the proper tone or method. My posts were factual and neutral in tone. Why should that offend?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T02:43:28-08:00","id":1347201,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I came across a little too strong there and didn't mean to derail your thread.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T11:32:10-08:00","id":1347294,"title":"","content":"You were in the right Zeea. Someone framing their blunt criticisms as &quot;just stating facts&quot; is just doubling down on being rude and arrogant.<br /> <br /> There was an open errata pass at these books. Not sure if your issues were included.<br /> <br /> If you do feel so strongly about this, instead of creating a public thread, I'd recommend PMing Ian on your platform of choice, potentially with a bit more courtesy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T11:54:38-08:00","id":1347301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1347294#post1347294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You were in the right Zeea. Someone framing their blunt criticisms as &amp;quot;just stating facts&amp;quot; is just doubling down on being rude and arrogant.<br /> <br /> There was an open errata pass at these books. Not sure if your issues were included.<br /> <br /> If you do feel so strongly about this, instead of creating a public thread, I'd recommend PMing Ian on your platform of choice, potentially with a bit more courtesy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly I am trying to be clear and straight forward. Why do I have to beg for the right to speak? <br /> <br /> I am sorry if you find this thread objectionable. I will certainly work to be polite. But if honestly stating issues in non insulting language isn't polite enough, what's left of free speech?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T15:26:57-08:00","id":1347330,"title":"","content":"The problem is that you are using insulting language. You're claiming some rather minor things in the larger scheme of actually playing the game are huge vital issues.<br /> <br /> The map has Plague Lands either misplaced, or one described in text isn't on the map. A nuisance if you're playing in Venezuela and want to know exactly where those Plague Lands are, but that's about it.<br /> <br /> The lack of internal divisions? You know that most countries on Earth have internal divisions right? Why should we be concerned about the former US and Canadian states/provinces/territories but not, say the states of Mexico? The lines on the map help you place where current modern day countries are in the new map of the era, which is more important.<br /> <br /> The way you've talked about the state of the world 100 years in the future, after superpowered beings exploded onto the scene, and then exploded the scene, is highly dismissive and contrarian to accepting the premise of the game; and especially lacking in examples as you just state that there are &quot;twists&quot; that are &quot;weird&quot; as a matter of fact.<br /> <br /> Here's a decent way to approach the one trivial but substantive issue raised:<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey Ian, I noticed the book talking about the Venezuelan Plague Lands, but the map only shows significant corruption zones in Argentina. Could you clarify this for me? If there's supposed to be significant Plague Lands in Venezuela, can you give me idea of how significant it would look on the map?&quot;<br /> <br /> --------------<br /> <br /> And really, you're going to lose any hope for the thread when you make declarations of free speech. There's nothing good that's going to come from that sort of obnoxious and hyperbolic appeal to rights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T16:22:26-08:00","id":1347340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1347330#post1347330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that you are using insulting language. You're claiming some rather minor things in the larger scheme of actually playing the game are huge vital issues.<br /> <br /> The map has Plague Lands either misplaced, or one described in text isn't on the map. A nuisance if you're playing in Venezuela and want to know exactly where those Plague Lands are, but that's about it.<br /> <br /> The lack of internal divisions? You know that most countries on Earth have internal divisions right? Why should we be concerned about the former US and Canadian states/provinces/territories but not, say the states of Mexico? The lines on the map help you place where current modern day countries are in the new map of the era, which is more important.<br /> <br /> The way you've talked about the state of the world 100 years in the future, after superpowered beings exploded onto the scene, and then exploded the scene, is highly dismissive and contrarian to accepting the premise of the game; and especially lacking in examples as you just state that there are &amp;quot;twists&amp;quot; that are &amp;quot;weird&amp;quot; as a matter of fact.<br /> <br /> Here's a decent way to approach the one trivial but substantive issue raised:<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Hey Ian, I noticed the book talking about the Venezuelan Plague Lands, but the map only shows significant corruption zones in Argentina. Could you clarify this for me? If there's supposed to be significant Plague Lands in Venezuela, can you give me idea of how significant it would look on the map?&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> --------------<br /> <br /> And really, you're going to lose any hope for the thread when you make declarations of free speech. There's nothing good that's going to come from that sort of obnoxious and hyperbolic appeal to rights.</div> </div> </div> </div>At least you specified your issues so I can respectfully take them into account. I might fail to meet your required standard but let me sincerely thank you for your clarity. <br /> <br /> I intend to continue the thread. But I'll try to be mannerly. I also plan to be frank. So if you'll remain clear in your critiques it will help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T18:33:45-08:00","id":1347368,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm not sure where you're from, so I'll try to give a perspective from my own country. Using the term &quot;defects&quot; in American often implies something serious that gets products recalled. Using the term &quot;illogical&quot; is often considered dismissive. The overall tone of the first post comes across as a demand rather than a request because of various word choices. &quot;The first set of issues I'd like cleared up,&quot; despite literally meaning &quot;it would be positive for me if this happened,&quot; is generally language that's associated with making demands. I don't really know how to explain it more than that, though. A better way to present a request like this would be, &quot;Hey, if it's not too much trouble, maybe we could get some clarification on X&quot; or &quot;It'd be really cool if the next supplement covers Y in more detail.&quot; You _did_ do a good job of this when you said &quot;maps of each continent would be very useful,&quot; though.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T18:36:56-08:00","id":1347371,"title":"","content":"Just to be clear, the standards I think you should be aiming for are:<br /> <br /> 1) Respect the difference between a game design choice you disagree with and an actual problem. Nations are not logical/rational actors. They are run by people who don't always do the &quot;right&quot; thing. Nor can we really say what would really happen in an alternate universe's future*. The history of Aeon is written as a game element to create a world that makes sense for the era Aeon takes place in. Fulfilling that goal by having a nation do something unexpected or seemingly out of character is not a problem, it's just a design choice. Likewise how much detail to put on a map is a design choice as you need to communicate important details without overloading the illustration.<br /> <br /> 2) Don't confuse &quot;nice&quot; language for non-insulting language. Being frank is fine, but if you really want the devs to pay this thread any mind? You have to pay attention to your language choices anyway. It's a lot easier to get feedback, discussion, and engagement with statements (however cliched or trite) in the form of, &quot;I'm struggling with how to reconcile Game Element A with Game Element B, how do you do it? Is there an official statement on it?&quot; than, &quot;Game Element A is illogical.&quot; The second isn't going to bring attention to any issues you have, and is minorly insulting even without being a direct attack on anyone; it comes off as harping the devs and writer screwing up rather than looking towards solutions.<br /> <br /> 3) There's limitations to print media. Two page spread images are going to have a crease in them, and similar to #1 you just have to accept there's no perfect solution to that (aving the PDF helps though). There's also limitations on things like page count, the core Aeon book can't cover everything in complete detail. Yes, you're looking for a supplement of some sort, but that's still going to be limited in how much it can cover. The globe is a big place, no single text is ever going to do it justice.<br /> <br /> 4) Don't pull really weak rhetorical appeals when a thread isn't going your way.<br /> <br /> <br /> * - As an exercise here, and as a way to consider framing future critiques in this thread, imagine going back to 1900, and trying to explain to someone how the world map would change into the present for us like it has, how the geopolitics have changed, and do so in a fashion that wouldn't come off as nonsensical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-09T20:19:52-08:00","id":1347388,"title":"","content":"You know, when I think about it? Try just going back to the late '90s when the Aeon Trinity setting was being developed and try to convince people of things that are true now. It'd sound ludicrous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-10T15:07:55-08:00","id":1347559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1347368#post1347368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I'm not sure where you're from, so I'll try to give a perspective from my own country. Using the term &amp;quot;defects&amp;quot; in American often implies something serious that gets products recalled. Using the term &amp;quot;illogical&amp;quot; is often considered dismissive. The overall tone of the first post comes across as a demand rather than a request because of various word choices. &amp;quot;The first set of issues I'd like cleared up,&amp;quot; despite literally meaning &amp;quot;it would be positive for me if this happened,&amp;quot; is generally language that's associated with making demands. I don't really know how to explain it more than that, though. A better way to present a request like this would be, &amp;quot;Hey, if it's not too much trouble, maybe we could get some clarification on X&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;It'd be really cool if the next supplement covers Y in more detail.&amp;quot; You _did_ do a good job of this when you said &amp;quot;maps of each continent would be very useful,&amp;quot; though.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm from the US. I'm very much on the left and I live in the southeast. Add to that the fact that I seem to read as gay (I'm Bi and fairly high in the Kensey numbers) which local reactionaries love to bring up in cheap insults So I've had to be on the defensive most of my 59 years <br /> <br /> It may push me towards being blunt .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-11T11:23:10-08:00","id":1347721,"title":"","content":"Some suggestions I'd like to make about the Aeon setting in North America.<br /> <br /> 1: It's a matter of taste but since they stressed the matter of agency when I got my Masters in History (Aspergers can play hob with spelling and writing style). It seems to me that there would be many groups outside of the Elites of the FSA that would favor the FSA. Examples would include the upperclasses of El Savador (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Salvador\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Salvador</a>) a group noted for brutal right-wing politics since the 18th century. The Native American tribes of eastern Nicaragua, who always fight with the central power of Nicaragua, and many other otherwise marginal groups. If the FSA plays divide and conquer, there would historically be many groups that would willingly play along.<br /> <br /> 2: This next one also comes from my history degree. The FSA is described as Fascist in the book, but the descriptions, while that of a right-wing authoritarian government, wasn't Fascist. Unless &quot;Fascist&quot; is used as a general pejorative, it has a clear meaning. The very fact that you've got a state that allows people to buy as many votes as they can afford and offers real due process to a portion of its citizens precludes the FSA being fascist. That Cassel can run his corporation as a separate power center within the FSA also precludes the FSA being Fascist. Could we call the FSA a plutocratic oligarchy (like present day Russia or China)? The term would be far more accurate.<br /> <br /> I hope these two were politely stated. I'll move on to other continents next.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-11T11:27:30-08:00","id":1347722,"title":"","content":"It's not a retraction, it's an apology. I got to see another copy of the Aeon book. The color printing on my map is defective. Everything else is okay though, I'm not asking for a replacement because that's the only flaw and it's so small. So sorry for saying the map colors weren't readable when it was only my copy. Forgive me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-11T19:02:59-08:00","id":1347817,"title":"","content":"Ah, we're both LGBT historians from the U.S. southeast on the autism/Aspergers spectrum. That's a kinda funny coincidence. I'd agree that the FSA is not actually a fascist state under traditional definitions, and that plutocratic oligarchy is a better description from a historical perspective. It's probably fascist under looser definitions of &quot;right-wing authoritarian with corporations involved so only a minor quibble there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T08:16:08-08:00","id":1348264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1347721#post1347721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some suggestions I'd like to make about the Aeon setting in North America.<br /> <br /> 1: It's a matter of taste but since they stressed the matter of agency when I got my Masters in History (Aspergers can play hob with spelling and writing style). It seems to me that there would be many groups outside of the Elites of the FSA that would favor the FSA. Examples would include the upperclasses of El Savador (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Salvador\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Salvador</a>) a group noted for brutal right-wing politics since the 18th century. The Native American tribes of eastern Nicaragua, who always fight with the central power of Nicaragua, and many other otherwise marginal groups. If the FSA plays divide and conquer, there would historically be many groups that would willingly play along.</div> </div> </div> </div>The writers are invested in the idea that the FSA is evilly stupid. The exception is the retcon of them being behind al-Qaeda in the UAN. Native Americans are also fetishised as pure spirits like the one Canadian Talent in Aberrant, so the Nicaraguan ones can't be used like that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2: This next one also comes from my history degree. The FSA is described as Fascist in the book, but the descriptions, while that of a right-wing authoritarian government, wasn't Fascist. Unless &quot;Fascist&quot; is used as a general pejorative, it has a clear meaning. The very fact that you've got a state that allows people to buy as many votes as they can afford and offers real due process to a portion of its citizens precludes the FSA being fascist. That Cassel can run his corporation as a separate power center within the FSA also precludes the FSA being Fascist. Could we call the FSA a plutocratic oligarchy (like present day Russia or China)? The term would be far more accurate.<br /> <br /> I hope these two were politely stated. I'll move on to other continents next. </div> </div> </div>They're using it like Orwell said it had become, anything the user doesn't like. The FSA as presented are the world's worst fascists, which should probably be a post of its own.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T10:21:34-08:00","id":1348288,"title":"","content":"The whole FSA is one of those elements of Aeon that I just don't like, at all, in no way. In fact its one of those elements that make me turn away from the setting while happily enjoying the mechanics. So basically I would totally approve of changes to it or fan made variances to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-13T11:01:22-08:00","id":1348301,"title":"","content":"A while back, there was a suggestion on how to address that issue for those who don't like the FSA. In short, swap North America and Europe. Instead of Europe being a post-apocalyptic ruin, North America is. Instead of North America being a fascist state, Europe is. There's even some logic to that: just say that the Aberrant war was very harsh on North America.<br /> <br /> Most of this can be done with some simple relocation and renaming. The \u00c6sculapean Order is focusing it's efforts in North America, not Europe, and is contending with Wycoff's Blight (which is more severe in this version of the setting), not <i>la Blessure</i> (which may not even exist; and if it does, it's not as severe as in the default setting). The FSA becomes the FSE, the successor to the European Union, and Orgotek's headquarters are located in Montressor, Switzerland. <br /> <br /> Matthieu (Matthew?) Zweidler was born and raised in America and is something of a \u201cmelting pot mutt\u201d with a geneology that branches out all over the world. Alexander Cassel is Greek. <br /> <br /> And so on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 11-13-2019, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T07:38:31-08:00","id":1348670,"title":"","content":"You could use a country that actually is fascist/national socialist in present day: China. However, Aeon has the negative reports about it to FSA and Australian propaganda. In Aberrant, its current RL practices are hand waved away by saying China became a model international citizen after N-Day (&quot;Uighurs? Who are they?&quot;)<br /> <br /> At least in 1st. ed, there was some admiration for the FSA surviving the Aberrant Wars, and there were Ale Cassel and the Truamericans who wanted to bring back America's ideals. 2nd has them as villains who are attacking Africa for the evilulz, being attacked in turn by South America in righteous vengence for actions over a century before. The only hope is intervention by the more enlightened outside world. Even the FSA NPC is a cheap shot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T08:46:55-08:00","id":1348673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1348670#post1348670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could use a country that actually is fascist/national socialist in present day: China.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fascists are extreme authoritarian right-wing. China's government is extreme authoritarian left-wing. National Socialist is a reference to the violently anti-communist NSDAP (Nazi Party), which is generally considered a subset of fascism. They're all bad guys, but they're not the same and they don't work the same way. You can't really have cyberpunk in a Communist setting because cyberpunk is about extreme capitalism where corporations control the ruling party and China is all about the ruling party controlling corporations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T09:04:05-08:00","id":1348675,"title":"","content":"Six of one, half a dozen of the other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T11:05:33-08:00","id":1348691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1348675#post1348675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Six of one, half a dozen of the other.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, they really are very different things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T11:11:42-08:00","id":1348694,"title":"","content":"Not in any way that matters to the people living under them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T12:55:37-08:00","id":1348710,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1348694#post1348694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not in any way that matters to the people living under them.</div> </div> </div> </div>EDIT: Actually, I don't want to derail this thread with a pointless argument.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1711,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","user":"Zeea","date":". 11-15-2019, 04:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-15T17:31:25-08:00","id":1348757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1348288#post1348288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The whole FSA is one of those elements of Aeon that I just don't like, at all, in no way. In fact its one of those elements that make me turn away from the setting while happily enjoying the mechanics. So basically I would totally approve of changes to it or fan made variances to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The original Aeon setting was about inversions. The folks on top now are on the bottom (or at least taken down multiple pegs) in the setting. South America is a manged biotech eco-paradise. Africa was called the Bright Continent (to contrast with &quot;Darkest Africa&quot;). Western Europe suffered a giant space station crashing down on it. And the United States became a full neo-feudalist/capitalist dystopia. The FSA is basically the future version of the setting of <i>The Purge</i>. Further focus on the FSA should very much include some kind of rip-off of that. Maybe for a very high fee, one can obtain certain specialized &quot;hunting licenses&quot; or have some area designated as a &quot;quantum flux zone&quot; that happens to have a lot poor, non-white people in it. Thus (obscenely wealthy and obscene) people can go into the area and slaughter the &quot;tainted&quot; in entertaining ways while wearing weird masks or whatever. I do wonder what this version of Alex Cassel will be like. The original one came off as the mutant lovechild of Barack Obama and Tony Stark.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-16T13:03:24-08:00","id":1348912,"title":"","content":"Moving over to Africa. My main fear is that they might go too generic. Just looking at the fact that all of North Africa is in their African Union is somewhat odd. The nations of North Africa tend to be proud of being part of MENA <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MENA\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MENA</a> (the Middle East and North Africa). Both Tunisia and Morocco have made their desire to join the European Union clear. However, if it's stated the entry of the North African states is very recent (and also it cost the FSA some prestige) then many issues in this and other areas are cleared up. <br /> <br /> Because I took coursework for my Masters in History on Africa (everybody had to take something big out of their main field) and took those courses from a man who spoke African Languages (about 14) fluently (he focused on oral histories) I'm very aware of just how vast and diverse Africa really is. I know I can't even list the main cultural areas. <br /> <br /> With West Africa, please don't ignore the rich literary culture or the film industry. You might have someone in a vignette mention a film about Sudiata Keita <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundiata_Keita\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundiata_Keita</a> (a major culture hero in West Africa, think of him as being like their King Arthur). Griots <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griot\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Griot</a> may be considered cliche, but many of West Africa's pop stars and major literary artists are from Griot families or have trained with Griots. It would be a vital part of their society.<br /> <br /> East Africa has had a multi millennia connection with India. They started the tales of Sinbad (Es Sindibad, the Indian). Their culture is musically rich (when I had a world music show on a college radio station back in the 1990's about two-thirds of the African music my listeners requested was from the Swahili Coast) and amazingly diverse and lively. It's also likely to be highly political. <br /> <br /> Africa has more forms of marriage than the rest of the Earth combined. Many marriages are of course for love. But many types of marriage are only about social obligation or social standing (although many lovers make use of such forms to meet personal needs). Gender can be amazingly fluid. A person's gender in many cultural groups can be situational. If it is useful to your family or community for you to be a man in one situation and a woman in another, you can be expected to play the role accordingly as a matter of respect and loyalty. It's more likely to be something genetic women are required/asked to do, but there are cultures where men can be in the same boat. <br /> <br /> Please, although a United Africa is an old Sci Fi thrope that goes back to the 1920's, and one I am personally fond of, please give good reasons for the United Africa in the Aeon setting existing. Maybe a group of Talents got together during the Aberrant Wars and decided to save Africa through unity and democracy. It would fit your setting and make logical sense of why a continent that has gotten kicked down so often is doing so well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-18T12:36:35-08:00","id":1349407,"title":"","content":"In Europe...<br /> <br /> Some questions to answer in the Atlas.<br /> <br /> Has Ireland been conquered by the United Republics?<br /> <br /> Why aren't Germany and Spain unifying internally given the threats around them?<br /> <br /> How is Iceland doing? <br /> <br /> How is Switzerland able to stay stable? How do they earn their living?<br /> <br /> Is Malta also part of United Africa? <br /> <br /> Is Provance coming together as it's own nation as it has many times in the past?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-18T17:32:07-08:00","id":1349469,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar702_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"702\" data-vbnamecard=\"702\">ElfSpeaker</a>, in Story Told overview on Aeon you mentioned that there are problems with portraying Center Europe, Russia or India in setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T04:43:00-08:00","id":1349541,"title":"","content":"I don't recall any problems with India. Central America, Russia, and Central Asia don't get any coverage. Ian has since clarified that Central America is divided between FSA and Sudamerica.<br /> <br /> The other issue is that they just that they talk about Western Europe and Eastern Europe and ignore Central Europe. That's really only applicable in during the Cold War, and even then, there were major differences between Central and Eastern Europe. Having lived in Prague, it's one of those bugbears I adopted from the Czechs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T06:56:53-08:00","id":1349578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1348673#post1348673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fascists are extreme authoritarian right-wing. China's government is extreme authoritarian left-wing. National Socialist is a reference to the violently anti-communist NSDAP (Nazi Party), which is generally considered a subset of fascism. They're all bad guys, but they're not the same and they don't work the same way. You can't really have cyberpunk in a Communist setting because cyberpunk is about extreme capitalism where corporations control the ruling party and China is all about the ruling party controlling corporations.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much since Deng and cemented when Xi came into power, Chinese Communist Party has given up on international communism and used nationalism to justify its power, specifically the history of the Han ethnic majority. If nationalism is your criterion for right-wing, then China is right-wing. What does cyberpunk have to do with anything? The question is about fascism. If there are private companies that are subordinate to the state as represented by the party, that's functionally fascism. The CCP is even putting a minority into concentration camps. I wonder if Tibet or Hong Kong will be mentioned in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-19T10:04:48-08:00","id":1349609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1349578#post1349578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty much since Deng and cemented when Xi came into power, Chinese Communist Party has given up on international communism and used nationalism to justify its power, specifically the history of the Han ethnic majority. If nationalism is your criterion for right-wing, then China is right-wing. What does cyberpunk have to do with anything? The question is about fascism. If there are private companies that are subordinate to the state as represented by the party, that's functionally fascism. The CCP is even putting a minority into concentration camps. I wonder if Tibet or Hong Kong will be mentioned in the book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nationalism isn't my criteria for right-wing. I mean, Stalin was a nationalist and while I wouldn't say he was quite as left-wing as Trotsky or someone, he still counted as left authoritarian.<br /> <br /> The cyberpunk mention is there because the entire point of the FSA was to create a Shadowrun/Cyberpunk/Gibson-esque location to game in, just like the other areas are designed for other sci-fi subgenres.<br /> <br /> I don't actually like Trinity's version of China, by the way, either the Aberrant or Aeon versions. But if the entire point was &quot;let's have a place where they can play Shadowrun,&quot; I wouldn't use a Communist state.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T07:26:44-08:00","id":1350224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1349609#post1349609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nationalism isn't my criteria for right-wing. I mean, Stalin was a nationalist and while I wouldn't say he was quite as left-wing as Trotsky or someone, he still counted as left authoritarian.<br /> <br /> The cyberpunk mention is there because the entire point of the FSA was to create a Shadowrun/Cyberpunk/Gibson-esque location to game in, just like the other areas are designed for other sci-fi subgenres.<br /> <br /> I don't actually like Trinity's version of China, by the way, either the Aberrant or Aeon versions. But if the entire point was &quot;let's have a place where they can play Shadowrun,&quot; I wouldn't use a Communist state.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nationalism is usually part of the definition for right-wing, except for Soviet propaganda that tried to lump all opposition to communism with Nazis as &quot;right-wing&quot;.<br /> <br /> Cyberpunk wasn't really a part of the FSA even in 1st ed. With the virtual disappearance of the genre, 2nd ed FSA is pretty much all fascist as opposed to Shadowrun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-22T07:40:16-08:00","id":1350227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>muon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1350224#post1350224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nationalism is usually part of the definition for right-wing, except for Soviet propaganda that tried to lump all opposition to communism with Nazis as &quot;right-wing&quot;.<br /> <br /> Cyberpunk wasn't really a part of the FSA even in 1st ed. With the virtual disappearance of the genre, 2nd ed FSA is pretty much all fascist as opposed to Shadowrun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I was going by the part of the book that mentions that the FSA is good for cyberpunk genres, and also the whole thing where it basically has shadowrunner teams as an adventure hook. I don't really think cyberpunk has disappeared, it's just morphed a bit in what it focuses on. Like, Shadowrun is still going, there's a new high-profile video game based on the Cyberpunk RPG, Fantasy Flight Games has a series of recent cyberpunk board games and an RPG setting based on them, etc. But I think we're talking in circles so we should probably just drop it so we don't take over the thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T03:20:27-08:00","id":1350417,"title":"","content":"I would change a bit the FSA with the removal of the second class citizen, and just point that by the end of Aberrant war, USA were broken and the companies took over the services on their responsibilities, becoming part of the government in a certain way. Canada and Mexico can be added as the 3 countries were facing problems and joined powers to face it.<br /> <br /> If you put that way, FSA is more about Cyberpunk 2020 and less facist.<br /> <br /> The only issue on the Cyberpunk is the lack of cybernetics on the setting as is, maybe Japan is not the only country using cybernetics, and that\u2019s the thing that makes Orgotech hated by the other companies, they are selling products that are superior to theirs and that they can\u2019t compete or interact directly.<br /> <br /> Other option is thinking Cybernetics must be biotech, more like the Replicants from Blade runner and less about Psionic Powers. Maybe Orgotech and the biotech come before the Psions and the Psitech... but than we are kicking a bit too far...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T08:33:28-08:00","id":1350443,"title":"","content":"A USA where the corporations stepped in and provide a large number of government services makes sense to me. A USA which took 'advantage' of the chaos of the increasingly hostile world in the lead up to the Aberrant War taking over Mexico and Canada makes sense to me, especially if warmongering corporations influenced matters. The second class citizens thing, the collapse of the US into the FSA and such, makes no sense. <br /> <br /> All that said I still don't think a world where novas were a major economic and political force is one where something like the FSA or even corporations would gain such a prominence. At least not in a country where novas were very popular and common.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T09:14:24-08:00","id":1350448,"title":"","content":"You know, you could probably do some really cool things with the FSA having some extra social artifacts from being such a hotbed of nova activity in the past. Like, in a Aeon/Aberrant-inspired post-apocalyptic game I just started, the FSA had special forces operatives with supers-style codenames and non-uniform colored gear because the idea of superheroes had been so ingrained in the culture. They didn't operate like superheroes or anything, and weren't really powerful, but they were portrayed in propaganda as James Bond-esque super-agents. Even with novas having gone bad, even with the backlash and the attempts to sorta wipe them out of public memory, North America had just gotten too attached to the concept. Especially when the FSA wanted to compete with psions for prestige.<br /> <br /> I really do feel like the FSA, like much of the ideas in Trinity 1e, is based on 1990s stereotypes writ large. Even the specific right-wing coalition feels a bit more to me like, I dunno, Newt Gingrich x 1000 than Donald Trump, but I don't know how to explain it. It also would sorta explain the way China developed or the Russia lunar settlement clumsily named after the Russian mob. I'm really not a huge fan of the Earth setting in Aeon, but like the FSA better than most of the other countries because it lets you go pew pew pew at Star Wars Imperial stormtroopers while fighting to restore the component countries to independent constitutional democracies or play Shadowrun with novas and psions. But I feel like my preferences wouldn't really do the original game justice and would be turning it into a different game.<br /> <br /> Still, if I were writing the setting and didn't have to worry about other people's desires at all? I'd probably go the opposite route and have nations be less important instead of more important. The Orders would have no geographic centers and absolutely no national loyalties. The various sci-fi subgenres would be found scattered all over the place instead of having each location have its own theme. And I'd probably have the bad guy groups and oppressive governments get turned into non-national forces too. Instead of the Federated States Military, maybe have some massive mercenary company that hires itself out to various petty dictators and also seizes control of poorly-controlled areas like the corruption wastes and the like. I mean, there can be some regional stuff, obviously, but the sharp divisions right now feel a little much. And honestly, some of the countries are so cringey and stereotypical that I feel uncomfortable including them in the game, especially Nippon. And I absolutely wouldn't want to run or play a campaign that treats the FSA as just another normal faction instead of a major villain that you're trying to overthrow. So, yeah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T11:58:38-08:00","id":1353916,"title":"","content":"On the subject of Russia. Putin is doing massive damage to Russia as it stands. Also, there is no way for the present Russian government to invest in it's people's health, education, and general welfare, without breaking the power of the Oligarchs. Putin is dependent on the Oligarchs to stay in office. Thus, although he knows he's destroying Russia, he can't both stay in office and do anything that might make things better, Thus, what kind of wreck is 22nd century Russia?<br /> <br /> China already wants to reclaim large areas Russia took from the Manchu Empire in the 17th, 18th, and 19th, centuries. China is already trying to get Russia to give them ports in the Arctic Ocean, much like Britain asked for Hong Kong. If China is as powerful as it is shown to be in this setting, and Russia is a rogue state in economic free fall, why doesn't China reclaim the vast territories Russia took from them in the past? <br /> <br /> Also, since Russia is pretty much post apocalyptic now, why are they still a state a century later? Are the people even descended from today's Russians?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-09T14:24:21-08:00","id":1353958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1350443#post1350443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A USA where the corporations stepped in and provide a large number of government services makes sense to me. A USA which took 'advantage' of the chaos of the increasingly hostile world in the lead up to the Aberrant War taking over Mexico and Canada makes sense to me, especially if warmongering corporations influenced matters. The second class citizens thing, the collapse of the US into the FSA and such, makes no sense.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't? You're telling me you can't turn on the news and see the shape of the FSA in America right now? I'm an American and my take on the FSA chapter in Aeon was &quot;That's highly unrealistic. Forget 2123, figure that's 50-75 years out at most if things stay as is.&quot;<br /> <br /> The essential American Myth/Story is the American Dream, &quot;America is the land of opportunity. If you have the courage, drive and smarts you can and will make a success of yourself.&quot;<br /> <br /> Of course, the corollary of that is &quot;If you're poor and unsuccessful it's <i>you're fault</i> for being too cowardly, lazy and stupid to succeed.&quot;<br /> <br /> The military-corporate state? President Dwight D. Eisenhower warned us all about the dangers of the military-industrial complex way back in the 1950s. That's nothing new.<br /> <br /> Fear of outsiders? The FSA annexation of Mexico could be complicated because we decided to Build The Wall to keep out all the &quot;Mexican rapists and criminals and maybe some nice people.&quot;<br /> <br /> You look at the FSA as a horrible but highly unlikely future. Our current American President would look at it as a &quot;To-Do&quot; list.<br /> <br /> I apologize for perhaps annoying some people by bringing in current politics, but I can't apologize for bringing in said politics as a rebuttal to Lord Heru's above statement. And I cannot help but believe that the developers of Trinity Continuum have drawn a great of inspiration for the FSA by looking at the current state of American politics and discourse.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1350443#post1350443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All that said I still don't think a world where novas were a major economic and political force is one where something like the FSA or even corporations would gain such a prominence. At least not in a country where novas were very popular and common.</div> </div> </div> </div>As I understand, the FSA came along during/after the Aberrant War as a response to the massive destructive that was inflicted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T01:37:17-08:00","id":1354089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1353958#post1353958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And I cannot help but believe that the developers of Trinity Continuum have drawn a great of inspiration for the FSA by looking at the current state of American politics and discourse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, the 2e FSA was written as a fallen dystopian nation during the Obama administration. What\u2019s happened since wasn\u2019t the inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:12:29-08:00","id":1354148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1354089#post1354089\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sadly, the 2e FSA was written as a fallen dystopian nation during the Obama administration. What\u2019s happened since wasn\u2019t the inspiration.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know. Are you sure you guys didn't do a bit of Nexus Surfing while working on this?<br /> <br /> Figure the easiest take on the FSA is &quot;It's The Purge with better tech.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:18:07-08:00","id":1354151,"title":"","content":"As someone who tends to be on the other side of the political spectrum, I don't see the FSA as being that far-fetched; it's just that they got the wrong culprits: rather than the whole thing being the result of a vast right-wing conspiracy and the military-industrial complex deciding to impose a fascistic regime on the continent, I would find it far more believable that the people who grabbed power after the Aberrant War were people who subverted the military and organized religion for their own ends. (On the other hand, the corporate side of the FSA scenario strikes me as unbelievable for an entirely different reason: our current crop of corporate leaders are far more likely to sell out to China than to support an American military coup. I could see the aforementioned subverted military <i>forcing</i> corporate leaders to do their bidding; but I don't see the business leaders willingly choosing to support them when there are far more profitable markets to turn to.)<br /> <br /> But I'm not into RPGs for the political messaging; I'm here for entertainment. As such, I much prefer an alternate scenario (brought up the last time this matter was raised) where the fates of Europe and North America are swapped: both are still essentially removed as the dominant powers of the setting; but North America's downfall is a direct result of being the epicenter of the Aberrant War and thus being thoroughly and utterly devastated, to the point that they're <i>still</i> trying to put themselves back together; this leads to more of a \u201cnew wild west\u201d scenario for North America. A fascistic European Union, by contrast, strikes me as all too believable: they've been there before. <br /> <br /> Two other aspects of the \u00c6on setting that I find difficult to believe are: <br /> <br /> 1. China isn't running everything. They've certainly been dealt a really good hand in the aftermath of the Aberrant War, which they won; but they <i>haven't</i> turned that victory into a domination of the globe, despite real-world signs of wanting to do just that. Especially with the power of mind control plopped right in their lap by their resident Psi Order. <br /> <br /> 2. The only way that \u00c6on's Africa makes any sense to me is if a mega-social Aberrant went across the continent sowing the seeds for cooperation among the various African cultures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:23:30-08:00","id":1354156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1354148#post1354148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know. Are you sure you guys didn't do a bit of Nexus Surfing while working on this?<br /> <br /> Figure the easiest take on the FSA is &quot;It's The Purge with better tech.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, the FSA was conceived during the Obama administration. It predates \u201cThe Purge\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:28:41-08:00","id":1354159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1354156#post1354156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Again, the FSA was conceived during the Obama administration. It predates \u201cThe Purge\u201d.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first Purge movie came out in 2013 (though the movie, <i>The First Purge</i> came out in 2018, as did the TV series).<br /> <br /> In any case, I'm not saying the developers got inspiration from The Purge (though perhaps they did). I'm saying that an easy way for GMs to conceptualize the FSA for players might be &quot;The Purge with better tech.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T08:50:52-08:00","id":1354168,"title":"","content":"Fair enough; though my earlier statement about my views of the FSA apply to The Purge, too (and also to The Handmaiden's Tale, and other such shows): I just don't find the stated motives of the chosen culprits to be believable. <br /> <br /> More to the point, I see such media as anti-conservative propaganda that plays up negative stereotypes instead of having any grounding in fact; and as I tend to identify with the groups that these movies and shows villainize, I tend to find them more offensive than entertaining. As a result, I generally don't watch that kind of media. As such, I don't find \u201cthe FSA is \u2018the Purge with better tech\u2019\u201d to be much of a selling point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-10T11:57:41-08:00","id":1354225,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1354168#post1354168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair enough; though my earlier statement about my views of the FSA apply to The Purge, too (and also to The Handmaiden's Tale, and other such shows): I just don't find the stated motives of the chosen culprits to be believable.<br /> <br /> More to the point, I see such media as anti-conservative propaganda that plays up negative stereotypes instead of having any grounding in fact; and as I tend to identify with the groups that these movies and shows villainize, I tend to find them more offensive than entertaining. As a result, I generally don't watch that kind of media. As such, I don't find \u201cthe FSA is \u2018the Purge with better tech\u2019\u201d to be much of a selling point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never got into <i>The Handmaid's Tale</i> and <i>The Purge</i> seemed kind of absurd on its face. &quot;All crime is legal, who are you gonna Purge tonight?&quot; &quot;Uh, nobody. I'm underwater on my mortgage. I'm gonna rob a bank and burn my house down for the insurance money 'cause all crime is legal.&quot;<br /> <br /> For me it's not about selling points. It's about finding ways to quickly connect players to a setting to which it really isn't intuitively easy to connect. I mean, think about it. This is a setting that kind of went from Indiana Jones to John Wick to the Marvel Cinematic Universe to The Expanse. That is some serious genre whiplash there. If I go through some droning exposition about the Aberrant War and the military-industrial complex and yadda-yadda, I'll get glazed eyes, snores and &quot;Do we really have to play this?&quot; from my players. But they can get the gist of the FSA from &quot;The Purge with way higher tech.&quot; The Legion? &quot;Remember Starship Troopers? Kind of like that.&quot; I can use familiar pop cultural references to connect my players with this setting AKA &quot;The Expanse but with psychic stuff.&quot; And at necessary points I can drill down and give them details to clarify things if, say, one of them wants to play a member of the Legion who's from the FSA.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 12-15-2019, 08:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-11T01:35:20-08:00","id":1354318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1353916#post1353916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the subject of Russia. Putin is doing massive damage to Russia as it stands. Also, there is no way for the present Russian government to invest in it's people's health, education, and general welfare, without breaking the power of the Oligarchs. Putin is dependent on the Oligarchs to stay in office. Thus, although he knows he's destroying Russia, he can't both stay in office and do anything that might make things better, Thus, what kind of wreck is 22nd century Russia?<br /> <br /> China already wants to reclaim large areas Russia took from the Manchu Empire in the 17th, 18th, and 19th, centuries. China is already trying to get Russia to give them ports in the Arctic Ocean, much like Britain asked for Hong Kong. If China is as powerful as it is shown to be in this setting, and Russia is a rogue state in economic free fall, why doesn't China reclaim the vast territories Russia took from them in the past? <br /> <br /> Also, since Russia is pretty much post apocalyptic now, why are they still a state a century later? Are the people even descended from today's Russians?</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC in 1ed Russia was \u2018leasing\u2019 a huge area of land to China, and was practically a Chinese puppet state.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8975,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8975-macd21","user":"macd21","date":". 12-11-2019, 04:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8975-macd21","name":"macd21","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-11T01:57:20-08:00","id":1354320,"title":"","content":"edit: double post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8975-macd21","name":"macd21","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-15T14:23:19-08:00","id":1355055,"title":"","content":"Isn't the FSA from Aeon 1e? That was like, Clinton administration. Is there really that much difference between the 1e and 2e versions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-15T17:30:57-08:00","id":1355088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1355055#post1355055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't the FSA from Aeon 1e? That was like, Clinton administration. Is there really that much difference between the 1e and 2e versions?</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019ve heard it said that some people feel that 1e didn\u2019t denounce fascism with enough conviction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-15T18:11:16-08:00","id":1355099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1355088#post1355088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019ve heard it said that some people feel that 1e didn\u2019t denounce fascism with enough conviction.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first &quot;full&quot; adventure in 1e Trinity came in <i>Hidden Agendas</i> with &quot;The Last Gasp.&quot; The premise of that adventure has the PCs lured into a trap by the FSA so they can be studied (and dissected later) like lab rats. America Offline (does anyone even remember AOL well enough to get that reference anymore?) gave a general overview of life in the FSA, which boiled down to &quot;sux unless you're really rich&quot; and &quot;really hostile to Psions&quot; (and the PCs are expected to be Psions).<br /> <br /> Beyond that the main takeaway in terms of the FSA is its irrelevance to the main story line in terms of official adventures. The PCs visit the FSA during the &quot;Signals and Flares&quot; adventure in the second Descent into Darkness adventure book, <i>Passage Through Shadow</i>. However, on that occasion they're guided/protected/put-on-leashes by Proxy Alex Cassel, so being in the FSA doesn't matter that match.<br /> <br /> I haven't looked too closely into the current take on the FSA, but I kind of liked how 1e treated them. They're bad people. But they're also a bunch that's generally irrelevant to the current state of humanity and growing more so by the year/month/week. Figure the worst fate for a fascist is to be ignored as irrelevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 12-15-2019, 09:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T12:32:40-08:00","id":1367579,"title":"","content":"Thinking on ways of making the FSA anti Africa policy less pointless I came up with &quot;What if there was a reason, wrong, but a reason, for the FSA's paranoia?&quot; This is what I came up with. <br /> <br /> Have several small Caribbean Island nations, fearful of being caught between the FSA and Latin America in an endless tug of war, and fearful of conquest by the FSA, join the UAN. Much like the Baltic States and most of the old Wasaw Pact nations joined NATO to protect their independence. Russia is still bitter and hostile over that. Although Putin is highly intelligent and fairly shrewd, he often acts in a stupidly evil way over what he sees as an insult and threat to Mother Russia (and his personal power and authority) and can't allow himself to see why those nations joined NATO out of fear. In the same way the FSA could refuse to see/understand the fears of those nations that joined the UAN.<br /> <br /> Note: Norca hates those nations joining the UAN as well. But they see it freaking out the FSA and thus causing the FSA trouble. So they let it slide and enjoy the show.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T13:40:27-08:00","id":1367596,"title":"","content":"More than once I questioned, WHY ANYONE MIGRATES TO FSA? its like nowadays migrating to Congo or North Korea (nothing against those countries, but all the wars and the dictators... not a good place to live). Anyone stupid enough to move to FSA would be treated as less than a person, why would they stay there?<br /> <br /> Europe is destroyed? Sure, but Australia would receive them smiling, Sudamerica and Africa would give them on a better condition (not great, but still better), the Extra Solar Colonies would be happy to have more fresh meat, Oceania would also need some people to gain political representation in general. Why FSA?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T16:50:49-08:00","id":1367646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1367596#post1367596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More than once I questioned, WHY ANYONE MIGRATES TO FSA? its like nowadays migrating to Congo or North Korea (nothing against those countries, but all the wars and the dictators... not a good place to live). Anyone stupid enough to move to FSA would be treated as less than a person, why would they stay there?<br /> <br /> Europe is destroyed? Sure, but Australia would receive them smiling, Sudamerica and Africa would give them on a better condition (not great, but still better), the Extra Solar Colonies would be happy to have more fresh meat, Oceania would also need some people to gain political representation in general. Why FSA?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's as if they assume that immigration to America is a mystical force. During the Great Depression the USA had out migration, we lost more than we took in ( we also illegally kicked some out, but that's a different story). And that period of population loss was when we were an isolationist nation behind oceanic moats, something that appealed to those trying not to be involved in Europe's ongoing miseries. You're totally right, Mateus Luz, no one would immigrate to the FSA. The only point is to have immigrants to oppress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T17:01:48-08:00","id":1367650,"title":"","content":"Random ones:<br /> <br /> <b>Iran is not Persia</b><br /> Why the hell did Iran become Persia. When most countries in the game now use endonyms, why did it revert? This seems to me something like a swtich for its own sake bourne out of when the gamew as originally written, not realizing that Persia was the exonym unitl the 20th Century. It never was Persia internally I don't see that changing in the future.<br /> <br /> <b>The UAN is Not Really Africa</b><br /> The UAN kind of weirds me out. Mostly in that it's kind of to me in an attempt to create a &quot;Diverse unified Africa&quot; actually more &quot;Squish everyhting remotely sub-Saharan African into one place regardless of realism.&quot; Like, how did Yorobun, to my understanding a non-porstetyzing religion mostly practiced by a particular ethnic group in West Africa, somehow oustrip Christianity, the largest estimated religion in Africa and fastest growing well into the Nova Age probably, to being reduced below Islam?<br /> <br /> Why is Swahili, a langauge mostly on the East Coast, used instead of actual langua francas used on the continent (The potential East African Federation uses English, Francophone Africa has monetary unions and trade unions, etc.) How does Egypt, Sudan, and the Maghreb fit into the reigon culturally? Having read Aeon the first time with 2e, something about the UAN feels to me something bore out of late 20th Century Pan-Africanist idealism which picks out the stuff foreigners (including some Americans) found intersting and painting as soemthing you can apply to the second largest continent and over a billion people. I think some better idea of how it is administered, and how federalized it is would do a good job at this to me. Like, did the EAF happen in Aeon? How does the fact that countires stuck to their colonial borders and languages in late 20th Century and through the 21st affect it? Does it have sub-regions that look like the old ECOWAS or South Africa? How do tradtionally Arab states work? Is the UAN an exansion of the African Union or soemthing else? Lots of things to me need to be talked on.<br /> <br /> Like, a real world fact is that in the real world, one of the biggest proponents of the African Union becoming a United States of Africa was Muammar Gaddafi. It is something not really popular with some nationalist movements, and some economic interests on the continent today. Things can change as we see in Europe, but I think there needs to be a lot more done to justify this thing since Africa is more diverse than I think the UAF is described as. To me, Yoruban becoming dominant on the continent at the same time Swahili becomes the international langauge feels like Nahuatl becoming the biggest religion in the UAN while at the same time French takes over.<br /> <br /> <b>Sudoamerica as a Whole</b><br /> I'm still not clear what this like, <i>is</i> in context of the of the setting. If it's just a description of the continent, but ht countries remain independent, not sure. If it is more unified, how does the non-Spanish speaking countries, especially Brazil, fit into things? Like, as a region it is fine, but I don't really see what is gained by lumping things together liek that. Eastern Europe didn't get its own special endonym but I get a sense Brazil and Colombia are as much one entity as Russia and Turkey.<br /> <br /> <b>Chile isn't Mapuche</b><br /> This feels a bit like the above two but on a smaller scale. The Mapuche Nation becoming independent or a thing in itself i can see. But the implication I got is that Chile no longer exists and that what was Chile is synonymous wiht Mapuche. Like, just looking at maps this isn't how it like...works. Mapuche are not as mall part of the population (over a million in a country of 18 million), but it kind of erases the range of diversity also in the country if we assume they just took over entirely. So some clarification on like...waht is Chile now would not hurt.<br /> <br /> <b>FSA Stuff</b><br /> Kind of agree that the FSA kind of is old hat. Like, I don't even mine the FSA being a right wing authoritarian state. I think the big issues is how, and why don't work out fo rme. And also why they didn't expand just beyond the modern day USMCA zone. Like, why didn't they kick the commies out of Cuba or invade Central America. The entire motivation to conquer Mexico doesn't sit right unless it is part of genral Offensive Monroe Doctrine Filllibustering Reborn that I gather, and that would probably result in bad times for Cuba and Panama. So kind of curious what made them stop when they got to Yukatan.<br /> <br /> I think a big thing too is that it uses fascism a bit too loosely. Like, I'm one to straight-up say that fascists are authoritarian, but not all authoritarians are fascist. I wouldn't call say, China or Soviet Russia fascist, but I would call them authoritarian. And to me, the FSA would be handled as I think the generally more negative stuff of the modern PRC look like (ie, authoritarian captialist) rather than the weird super MIC-Captailst that it is in the default setting. I think how it's organized wouldn't hurt either. Did all the provinces of Canada and Mexico's states become states? Is it administere din a way that at all looks like the three countries it gobbled-up?<br /> <br /> <b>Nippon is Weird</b><br /> I guess this is to me, but Nippon feels very much like Japan was perceived in the early and late 90s, withotu accoutning for 1) The bubble and stagflation and 2) Japan despite being hyper-modernist also likes at least having its nice nature spots. The Nippon Archology feels odd to me, but I guess the Aberrant Age effed things up a bit. I just would expect way more parks and pretty historical monuments in it instead of it being a something out of a Tsutomo Nihei manga.<br /> <br /> <b>Bharati Commonwealth is...Awkward</b><br /> The current upswing of Hindu nationalism in India kind of makes me think that there needs to be some thought put on on like, what the Bharati Commonwealth even is. Something I saw suggested I don't mind is that before it forms, probably Pakistan and India have to have dissolved. Like, in my mind rather than it being the modern countries its territory comprises, I could see like....Tamil, Sikhistan, Rajastan, and such having become thier own things. Basically rather than the modern states squished togehter, the constituate staes fell apart and came back together. When there's not one &quot;India&quot; but half a dozen things that use to be India that dont' form a bloc, then I think the whole setup becomes more plausable to me.<br /> <br /> <b>China and the CARs</b><br /> I think to make the CARs more believeable the whole Bhoddisatva thing needs to be emphasized more. China as it is going today makes a lot of the China in Aeon feel pretty implausable, but if it were in context of &quot;We dont' know how this work due to us being stuck with Aberrant inventions&quot; I think some of it works otu better. That said, the status of Hong Kong, Taiwan, and Malaysia probably could use some more detailing. And why some coutnries are in the CAR sphere and not say, tried to join Australlia or the Bharati Commonwealth.<br /> <br /> <b>Israel-Palestine is Pretty Awkward Too</b><br /> Just saying based on recent events, I kind of wonder how much it is a good idea to spend a lot of tiem on this. But the current One State well, state, in context of recent ehadlines is pretty awkward to me. And I wonder how far one can go with &quot;Aberrant War makes strange bedfellows' in this area.<br /> <br /> <b>Antarctica</b><br /> Why isn't this really talked about at all? Kind of cuirous what is going on there. Seems like a good spot for countries to fight over or for folks to have setup colonies or a lot of resoruces or archologies or whatever. Is it just not very useful due to being far away I guess? Inquirng minds must know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 02-13-2020, 08:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-13T22:05:37-08:00","id":1367686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1367650#post1367650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Random ones:<br /> <br /> *SNIP*</div> </div> </div> </div>The simplest answer to your question beyond &quot;Chill out, it's just a game setting&quot; is &quot;Shit happens over time.&quot;<br /> <br /> Let's say that you were born in the USA in 1870. How much of what happened by 1970 would you have predicted? Airplanes. WWI and WWII. The atomic bomb. Men landing on the fucking Moon and bringing rocks back.<br /> <br /> Aeon is setting a little over a hundred years from now. And it takes place on an Earth where stuff like Psionics, Quantum Superpowers and Talents/Movie Action folks are real things. <br /> <br /> You mentioned Russia. I recall the Union of Soviet Socialistic Republics and never expected to live to see it come apart. There would either be a world-ending nuclear apocalypse or a statemate between the USA and USSR that would continue well into the future. And the whole enterprise collapsed in the early 90s. And while Russia under Putin isn't exactly a nice place, it's not like the Cold War era of &quot;the missiles are flying.&quot; Call that my attitude circa 1985 and less than 10 years later the USSR as a political entity, had ceased to exist. That's what happened in ten years? And you're questioning stuff that's over a hundred years away? In a world with &quot;magic superpowers?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-14T13:46:10-08:00","id":1367851,"title":"","content":"I mean, this is a thread quesitoning how the nations got to where they are and how they got that way. I have genuine interest in geopolitics and have an emphasis on that in some of the research I've done. So a lot of stuff stood out. And in trying to make the setting more believeable some things need addressed basically.<br /> <br /> Note the only one I think I'm super hostile on is Iran to Persia. Since that one sort of just straight-up break sthe exonym to endonym pattern for the rest of the setting and seems built on if anything kind of outright ignorance from the 90s.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-14T16:07:00-08:00","id":1367905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1367851#post1367851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, this is a thread quesitoning how the nations got to where they are and how they got that way. I have genuine interest in geopolitics and have an emphasis on that in some of the research I've done. So a lot of stuff stood out. And in trying to make the setting more believeable some things need addressed basically.<br /> <br /> Note the only one I think I'm super hostile on is Iran to Persia. Since that one sort of just straight-up break sthe exonym to endonym pattern for the rest of the setting and seems built on if anything kind of outright ignorance from the 90s.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admire your interest in geopolitics, heck, my masters, which I never got to use professionally, is in history. Like you I find much of the setting strange in dull unimaginative ways. I found the richness and depth of your statements refreshing.<br /> <br /> Thank you for posting to my thread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T19:19:56-08:00","id":1368201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1367851#post1367851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, this is a thread quesitoning how the nations got to where they are and how they got that way. I have genuine interest in geopolitics and have an emphasis on that in some of the research I've done. So a lot of stuff stood out. And in trying to make the setting more believeable some things need addressed basically.<br /> <br /> Note the only one I think I'm super hostile on is Iran to Persia. Since that one sort of just straight-up break sthe exonym to endonym pattern for the rest of the setting and seems built on if anything kind of outright ignorance from the 90s.</div> </div> </div> </div>Figure at least some of those questions will get answers when the <i>Terra Firma</i> book comes out... eventually. I think I'm with you on the Persia/Iran thing. Apparently &quot;Iran&quot; actually Farsi for &quot;Persia.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-15T19:42:30-08:00","id":1368205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368201#post1368201\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Figure at least some of those questions will get answers when the <i>Terra Firma</i> book comes out... eventually. I think I'm with you on the Persia/Iran thing. Apparently &quot;Iran&quot; actually Farsi for &quot;Persia.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s exactly the anoying point, we call Nippon (tha japanese for Japan) and call Persia (the non local name for Iran). Why? If it was up to me, I would say that as religion lost some power and the government would want to be more inclusive with the invaded countries, they changed to a more \u201cneutral\u201d or \u201cfriendly\u201d, but the descriptions says the name was changed before the reduction on religion in politics. So... weird...<br /> <br /> Also, not sure if Iran or Iraq that dominated the others and become Persia \u201cAfter Iran expanded into Turkmenistan and the still-habitable portions of Iran, \u201c (Aeon, page 68). My bet is Iran invaded the remaining of Iraq as half or Iraq is in the wastelands.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T01:37:18-08:00","id":1368246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368205#post1368205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s exactly the anoying point, we call Nippon (tha japanese for Japan) and call Persia (the non local name for Iran). Why? If it was up to me, I would say that as religion lost some power and the government would want to be more inclusive with the invaded countries, they changed to a more \u201cneutral\u201d or \u201cfriendly\u201d, but the descriptions says the name was changed before the reduction on religion in politics. So... weird...<br /> <br /> Also, not sure if Iran or Iraq that dominated the others and become Persia \u201cAfter Iran expanded into Turkmenistan and the still-habitable portions of Iran, \u201c (Aeon, page 68). My bet is Iran invaded the remaining of Iraq as half or Iraq is in the wastelands.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, in our own current real world, Iraq has pretty much fallen into Iran's orbit along with Syria. Maybe they were extrapolating from that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:14:06-08:00","id":1368253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1367596#post1367596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More than once I questioned, WHY ANYONE MIGRATES TO FSA? its like nowadays migrating to Congo or North Korea (nothing against those countries, but all the wars and the dictators... not a good place to live). Anyone stupid enough to move to FSA would be treated as less than a person, why would they stay there?<br /> <br /> Europe is destroyed? Sure, but Australia would receive them smiling, Sudamerica and Africa would give them on a better condition (not great, but still better), the Extra Solar Colonies would be happy to have more fresh meat, Oceania would also need some people to gain political representation in general. Why FSA?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah the whole FSA is a big eyeroll to me. It feels it was done less as a fun nuanced part of the setting and more of a pat yourself on the back political point. And cool that means if you are Mexican or North American First Nation your stories are mostly non existent.<br /> <br /> And it really seems eyeroll-y to have Japan called Nippon, that's silly that's that's like if we made a setting and China can't call America Meiguo and they only call it America. Or Greece isn't Greece anymore only Hellas. Or India is Bharat. Honestly to me its as silly as using Kueijin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:31:19-08:00","id":1368261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368253#post1368253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah the whole FSA is a big eyeroll to me. It feels it was done less as a fun nuanced part of the setting and more of a pat yourself on the back political point.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s only a \u2018pat yourself on the back political point\u2019 if you think FSA was written after America headed down the path it\u2019s now on. In fact, first edition FSA was written way before this, and second edition FSA was written during the (generally) more hopeful times of the Obama administration.<br /> <br /> In both instances, the FSA isn\u2019t intended as any real world political commentary. It\u2019s intended as a corporate cyberpunk dystopia so you can run Shadowrun and Cyberpunk-type games If you want to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:56:18-08:00","id":1368268,"title":"","content":"Even in the early two thousands I've known people that would have patted considered these <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">\u2018pat yourself on the back political point\u2019 settings, not at all limiting it to modern day.<br /> <br /> But things start to come apart at the seems when you try to mash, Judge Dredd/Star Trek/Shadowrun/Bladerunner/Mad Max/Fallout/Mass Effect in the same setting. For one Economy seems wonky when you consider off world resources would be exponentially greater then terrestrial ones but a lot of that is toned down so you can have access to some setting cohesions of these Genre locals.<br /> <br /> It just seems you can't quite do each Genre/homage justice in a combined setting. Corporate Dystopia becomes more and more headscratchy when you consider how most of the world works, and that off world colonies are a thing.<br /> <br /> <br /> It would work better using different planets as a microcosm rather then different countries, but then you lose a lot when its not set in actual England or actual Japan.<br /> <br /> And it just seems conquering Mexico and Canada is way more trouble then its worth as an answer to a resource shortage when you literally have Hyperfusion. If it was something like taking Tech, or even a rare type of Populace ( like I don't know they wanted to breed new Novas or some sort of superhuman) yeah but food and water... you essentially cannonball your own position in world diplomacy and economy for something massive vertical farming procedures could have taken care of. I mean verisimilitude damage can be curbed with further explanations in other supplements, but its on shaky ground. Why Dystopian Cyberpunk settings and other post apocalyptic settings work is because they exist in a mostly universal state. Otherwise you are asking why is Captain Picard allowing jackboots and brainwashing on his front lawn.<br /> <br /> Not a jab but from my experience many people have loved Trinity and Scion in both iterations but they were always much more willing to make the setting their own as compared to the two world of Darknesses where most of the time I see people play the setting as is unless doing a special chronicle every now and then, (Werewolves... in... SPAAAAAaaaaace!).</span></span></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T02:59:57-08:00","id":1368270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368253#post1368253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah the whole FSA is a big eyeroll to me. It feels it was done less as a fun nuanced part of the setting and more of a pat yourself on the back political point. And cool that means if you are Mexican or North American First Nation your stories are mostly non existent.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is plenty of stories to be told in FSA, they just don\u2019t follow the original Meta-Plot. Cyberpunk and Shadowrun for example have a huge number of good material to be used as base. But cyberpunk in general works on local scale while we tend to run Aeon on the macro setting, removing most of the isolated countries from the game (it includes FSA, Nippon and Persia).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T03:11:53-08:00","id":1368271,"title":"","content":"Early 2000s was another weird time. Most of the Europe and South America were getting deeper on the left/labor side of the scale, while America was becoming more and more \u201csecurity aware\u201d and taking rights away for national security reasons. This setting was written in the 90s, before 9/11 and during a time the news were about a secretary doing BJs in the oval room, not about war, how youth is distorting economy and right/left wings. America was in constant war, sure, but USSR was gone and there was no China to compete with USA. America was in the best place in its history.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T03:27:59-08:00","id":1368273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368271#post1368271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Early 2000s was another weird time. Most of the Europe and South America were getting deeper on the left/labor side of the scale, while America was becoming more and more \u201csecurity aware\u201d and taking rights away for national security reasons. This setting was written in the 90s, before 9/11 and during a time the news were about a secretary doing BJs in the oval room, not about war, how youth is distorting economy and right/left wings. America was in constant war, sure, but USSR was gone and there was no China to compete with USA. America was in the best place in its history.</div> </div> </div> </div>I chalked it up to teenagers being edgey and familiarity breeding contempt, both of which seem universal. The same people who I heard saying 9/11 didn't matter because it was the US would have probably said the same thing if we were born a decade earlier.<br /> <br /> But how close are the two editions expected to be? I'm mostly talking 2nd ed. And with Exalted they took more liberties changing from 2nd to 3rd ed then 1st to 2nd.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T08:01:10-08:00","id":1368300,"title":"","content":"They changed a lot the entire world. For example Nor\u00e7a was a bunch of narcos and they become ecoterrorists. but FSA is still basically the same.<br /> <br /> The true is FSA is not the center of any thing in the setting. the America Offline supplement from first edition added more about the relationship Aeon Trinity x FSA and Orgotek x FSA than about the country itself (as long as I recall, I didn't read it cover to cover and what I read was a few year back).<br /> <br /> We don't need to make FSA as bad as it is portrayed, even without breaking the descriptions for the setting. It is pacific most of time, you can go for some bounty hunting after both ilegal people and criminals, or doing some jobs for the mega corporations, there is the Blight covering a huge part of the countryside and giving a lot of opportunities for monster hunting, all that without touching politics.<br /> <br /> The life of poor people in FSA is not different from the life of poor immigrants in USA now, they don't get access to voting and can be sent to concentration camps if bringing too much official attention to you (like the ones they are putting the ilegal immigrants nowadays). If you prefer you can go for legal and political things (like the modern day Washington DC movies, but representing companies and not the people), or can work as a &quot;double agent&quot; working and trafficking information between 2 mega corporations as if they were countries.<br /> <br /> The point in FSA is really it is not part of the main meta plot (originally), but as there is no meta plot in second edition, there is nothing that would keep you away form FSA (except if you are not a citizen...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T17:56:26-08:00","id":1368437,"title":"","content":"I mean I'm poor in the US now and I don't have voting restrictions or threat of being sent to a concentration camp... so it does sound different from now...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T18:40:41-08:00","id":1368440,"title":"","content":"I look at the Aeon setting and I think of the Orders and I think of space, I don't really think of the Earth nations itself. I would have much preferred if something like a global Earth government had been formed in the aftermath of the war that looks like its a single government but that when you dig deeper all the conflicts of the old states are still there, just hidden. <br /> <br /> All that said the FSA is the opposite of interesting and fun for me and so its something I don't think I would ever focus my ST attention on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T18:43:05-08:00","id":1368441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368437#post1368437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean I'm poor in the US now and I don't have voting restrictions or threat of being sent to a concentration camp... so it does sound different from now...</div> </div> </div> </div>what I meant was poor people would be treated like poor IMMIGRANTS.<br /> <br /> they only risk being overcharged for crimes if they are criminals or be framed, otherwise they are just poor...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 02-16-2020, 09:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T18:45:43-08:00","id":1368443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368440#post1368440\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All that said the FSA is the opposite of interesting and fun for me and so its something I don't think I would ever focus my ST attention on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree. I would prefer something more like the Expanse, a global earth government and the colonies working towards their independence.<br /> <br /> But still, the opportunities are there...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T23:00:08-08:00","id":1368465,"title":"","content":"FSA honestly could work with just being an example of democratic backsliding. I think the addition of corptocracy is kind of just an unneeded layer myself. Like, I don't mind it on prinicple. I think it's more that the specific implementation is a bit late 90s/early 00s in its nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T23:08:19-08:00","id":1368466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368205#post1368205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That\u2019s exactly the anoying point, we call Nippon (tha japanese for Japan) and call Persia (the non local name for Iran). Why? If it was up to me, I would say that as religion lost some power and the government would want to be more inclusive with the invaded countries, they changed to a more \u201cneutral\u201d or \u201cfriendly\u201d, but the descriptions says the name was changed before the reduction on religion in politics. So... weird...<br /> <br /> Also, not sure if Iran or Iraq that dominated the others and become Persia \u201cAfter Iran expanded into Turkmenistan and the still-habitable portions of Iran, \u201c (Aeon, page 68). My bet is Iran invaded the remaining of Iraq as half or Iraq is in the wastelands.</div> </div> </div> </div>So Iran never actually called itself Persia. But it was the official exonym for the country until the early 20th Century. In the forming of nationalism though, Iran being the name for the state had additiona meaning as it was not the name for a specific ethnic group, but the country. About half of Iran today is what we would call ethnically Persian. It also has Arabs, Kurds, Turks, Pashtuns, and all sorts of other groups living in there. Reza Shah formally asked other countries to stop referring ot the country as Persia and to Iran if they could, and the country that most dragged its foot on it was the UK.<br /> <br /> (There's an amusing video on the topic <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zoyctsgMwq0\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, though I'll note that I actually knew about all thsi before it. Just found it neat there's a summary video on the topic.)<br /> <br /> But yeah, in context of &quot;Trying to find a name that covers the area more&quot; it is actually a <i>less</i> useful therm than Iran is, as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greater_Iran\" target=\"_blank\">Iranshahr/Greater Iran</a> encompasses a lot more than the modern state or Aeon Persia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 02-17-2020, 04:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-16T23:17:26-08:00","id":1368469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368253#post1368253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah the whole FSA is a big eyeroll to me. It feels it was done less as a fun nuanced part of the setting and more of a pat yourself on the back political point. And cool that means if you are Mexican or North American First Nation your stories are mostly non existent.<br /> <br /> And it really seems eyeroll-y to have Japan called Nippon, that's silly that's that's like if we made a setting and China can't call America Meiguo and they only call it America. Or Greece isn't Greece anymore only Hellas. Or India is Bharat. Honestly to me its as silly as using Kueijin.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is something that does happen today though. See the official want of the Latinization of Kiev to Kyev and dropping &quot;the&quot; from Ukraine, the recent name changes of Eswatini (formerly Swaziland), Czechia (now an offical alternative to the Czech Republic), and the changed Anglizations of various Indian cities such as Mumbai or Kulkuta. You see it in other areas too, such as the Japanese government requesting that Japanese names, when translated into other langauges, retain the surname first pattern. (Something often done for Chinese and Korean names already)<br /> <br /> Persia is also awkward in context of Aeon, since Nippon, Sudoamerica, Bharati, andMagyarorszag are obvious use of endonyms, yet one of the biggest ones seem to be a change for its own sake, since Iran use to be Persia and authors thought that it was a return ot the pre-colonial name, rather the opposite.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T06:20:55-08:00","id":1368519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368441#post1368441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> what I meant was poor people would be treated like poor IMMIGRANTS.<br /> <br /> they only risk being overcharged for crimes if they are criminals or be framed, otherwise they are just poor...</div> </div> </div> </div>The poor have faced harsher penalties for crimes, and less fair trials as well, since Babylon and Summer. The USA is well above world historical norms in terms of Social Justice. However, the USA has pushed standards of Social Justice higher, so we now look brutal and primitive.<br /> <br /> In spite of the scorn and cheap insults the USA faces, this is a good thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T09:16:43-08:00","id":1368544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368465#post1368465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">FSA honestly could work with just being an example of democratic backsliding. I think the addition of corptocracy is kind of just an unneeded layer myself. Like, I don't mind it on prinicple. I think it's more that the specific implementation is a bit late 90s/early 00s in its nature.<br /> <br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">It is something that does happen today though. See the official want of the Latinization of Kiev to Kyev and dropping &quot;the&quot; from Ukraine, the recent name changes of Eswatini (formerly Swaziland), Czechia (now an offical alternative to the Czech Republic), and the changed Anglizations of various Indian cities such as Mumbai or Kulkuta. You see it in other areas too, such as the Japanese government requesting that Japanese names, when translated into other langauges, retain the surname first pattern. (Something often done for Chinese and Korean names already)</span></span></div><br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Persia is also awkward in context of Aeon, since Nippon, Sudoamerica, Bharati, andMagyarorszag are obvious use of endonyms, yet one of the biggest ones seem to be a change for its own sake, since Iran use to be Persia and authors thought that it was a return ot the pre-colonial name, rather the opposite.</span></span></div><br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>It would work better if say they erected an invincible Dome, or Wall, using lost Q-Tech that separated the continent from the world and then maybe experiment with capitalism and democracy going haywire, so they could still appear democratic but its the worst problems of democracy Mob Rule, so the Majority oppresses the Minority, and everything is for sale. I think of Pentex and how consumerism is displayed in Invader Zim as good examples.<br /> <br /> And those are excellent examples of names changing. But with the nature of speaking a language that isn't your own even if they took up an initiative to name it Nippon it would still not be pronounced the same as Japanese speakers, and really even in one country you will have enough diversity in speech that it would be pronounced distinctly from one coast to the next, so the same problem would manifest again. It feels like it would need a mighty initiative to succeed in changing its name in other languages while making it stick and getting accurate results.<br /> <br /> Aeon setting makes it seem like the world achieved a greater polyglottal finesse. If you change things then there will just be a host of other newer adaptions and bastardizations of language. I mean you can't even properly express most of these authentically the basic alphabet that doesn't use things like accent marks.<br /> <br /> And the book is in English, but I get the feeling English isn't as major a language in the future as the present. So what language is this assumed to be spoken in? Still English?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T11:00:35-08:00","id":1368580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368544#post1368544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would work better if say they erected an invincible Dome, or Wall, using lost Q-Tech that separated the continent from the world and then maybe experiment with capitalism and democracy going haywire, so they could still appear democratic but its the worst problems of democracy Mob Rule, so the Majority oppresses the Minority, and everything is for sale. I think of Pentex and how consumerism is displayed in Invader Zim as good examples.</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically I think more reading of books like <i>How Democracies Die</i> or <i>Seeing Like a State</i> woudl be more informative of what's going on in the FSA than I think what we go tnow. THere are books on the topic that I think just give better ideas and probably what I will use if I ever were to run a game in Aeon.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368544#post1368544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And those are excellent examples of names changing. But with the nature of speaking a language that isn't your own even if they took up an initiative to name it Nippon it would still not be pronounced the same as Japanese speakers, and really even in one country you will have enough diversity in speech that it would be pronounced distinctly from one coast to the next, so the same problem would manifest again. It feels like it would need a mighty initiative to succeed in changing its name in other languages while making it stick and getting accurate results.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, but that's not why they do it. It's to make it so that when they hear folks say the name of a country or place people think is important, it at least lines-up with their identity to that place. In context of Aeon's Nippon, it is pretty clearly to me a nationalist move that is as much about national pride as it is clarity. So hearing the American butcher something that still sounds like the term they use in everday life is going to be more wanted in these contexts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368544#post1368544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aeon setting makes it seem like the world achieved a greater polyglottal finesse. If you change things then there will just be a host of other newer adaptions and bastardizations of language. I mean you can't even properly express most of these authentically the basic alphabet that doesn't use things like accent marks.<br /> <br /> And the book is in English, but I get the feeling English isn't as major a language in the future as the present. So what language is this assumed to be spoken in? Still English?</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends. I'm one to think Arabic, English or French would have become the langua franca in the UAN before Swahili did. More people speak those in a broader area. Australia and Bharati together probably constitute a pretty sizeable encouragement to use of English globally as well I would think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 02-18-2020, 02:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T11:01:14-08:00","id":1368581,"title":"","content":"Also note I guess to add, I wouldn't be surprised if most people's personal assisstants don't just have a real-time translation feature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T11:38:55-08:00","id":1368593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368519#post1368519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The poor have faced harsher penalties for crimes, and less fair trials as well, since Babylon and Summer. The USA is well above world historical norms in terms of Social Justice. However, the USA has pushed standards of Social Justice higher, so we now look brutal and primitive.<br /> <br /> In spite of the scorn and cheap insults the USA faces, this is a good thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not insulting USA, what I mean is, illegal immigrants face the immigration laws only when they are doing something bad (usually). When it happens they go to the jail, and stay on camps waiting for deportation.<br /> <br /> Poor people now don\u2019t have to worrie about it, even if they are legal immigrants. But on FSA they may have issues... that\u2019s the point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T11:40:48-08:00","id":1368595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368581#post1368581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also note I guess to add, I wouldn't be surprised if most people's personal assisstants don't just have a real-time translation feature.</div> </div> </div> </div>Page 286, second column, bottom of paragraph 1.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T12:16:14-08:00","id":1368609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368580#post1368580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Sure, but that's not why they do it. It's to make it so that when they hear folks say the name of a country or place people think is important, it at least lines-up with their identity to that place. In context of Aeon's Nippon, it is pretty clearly to me a nationalist move that is as much about national pride as it is clarity. So hearing the American butcher something that still sounds like the term they use in everday life is going to be more wanted in these contexts.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>But that's the point Japan is derived from Nippon, its the attempt to capture another language's name in a time before recordings. With recordings its easier to establish fidelity if they can anchor it to the public memory, but language drift is pretty inevitable and Japan's \u65e5\u672c will be different from a different language's Nippon. My personal experience if you speak a word in Japanese (and Mandarin and Cantonese) and don't emulate the languages accent rather then using an American accent it can easily fly over their head unless they are paying close attention to the conversation and understand the context of the word you butchered in pronunciation.<br /> <br /> So basically all I'm saying is Japan and Nippon would pretty much the same because people are going to mispronounce Nippon looping back to the Creation of the word Japan in the first place. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T12:17:55-08:00","id":1368610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368593#post1368593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am not insulting USA, what I mean is, illegal immigrants face the immigration laws only when they are doing something bad (usually). When it happens they go to the jail, and stay on camps waiting for deportation.<br /> <br /> Poor people now don\u2019t have to worrie about it, even if they are legal immigrants. But on FSA they may have issues... that\u2019s the point.</div> </div> </div> </div>But their camps wouldn't be used for deportation. They would have wholly different purposes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T13:50:04-08:00","id":1368632,"title":"","content":"Not sure which of the two threads this goes in - But I honestly think a fan reimagining of the national setup of Aeon Earth might be fun and useful. I say this because, as I have commented before, I just don't really care for how its set up in canon, in either edition (and Aberrant as well, but thats not thefocus here), and think coming up with alternate ideas might be fun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T14:35:03-08:00","id":1368638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368632#post1368632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure which of the two threads this goes in - But I honestly think a fan reimagining of the national setup of Aeon Earth might be fun and useful. I say this because, as I have commented before, I just don't really care for how its set up in canon, in either edition (and Aberrant as well, but thats not thefocus here), and think coming up with alternate ideas might be fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Imo it is ultimately not that interesting. Their importance to the setting at large is truly looooooooow. I could change earth into a radioactive wasteland and it would still have minimal effect on the orders and the wider setting. They are more defined by their ability and role. They are not really part of their nations in significant degrees. Even telepaths are kinda sorta only there, but they still stand alone. You can do too much with it without really impacting the wider setting unless you want to. They are background at the end of the day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6491-zorb42","name":"zorb42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T16:24:25-08:00","id":1368641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368593#post1368593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am not insulting USA, what I mean is, illegal immigrants face the immigration laws only when they are doing something bad (usually). When it happens they go to the jail, and stay on camps waiting for deportation.<br /> <br /> Poor people now don\u2019t have to worrie about it, even if they are legal immigrants. But on FSA they may have issues... that\u2019s the point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't mean to criticize you. If it came off that way, then it is my failure to write clearly that's to blame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T17:43:59-08:00","id":1368650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zorb42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368638#post1368638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Imo it is ultimately not that interesting. Their importance to the setting at large is truly looooooooow. I could change earth into a radioactive wasteland and it would still have minimal effect on the orders and the wider setting. They are more defined by their ability and role. They are not really part of their nations in significant degrees. Even telepaths are kinda sorta only there, but they still stand alone. You can do too much with it without really impacting the wider setting unless you want to. They are background at the end of the day.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. I actually very much agree with this. To me Aeon is cool because the Orders and space stuff while the Earth stuff is just there, is interchangable. Still coming up with an Earth setting could be fun, which is why I suggested it. hehe","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T20:09:39-08:00","id":1368670,"title":"","content":"Well to Start with I would maybe have Judge Dredd Style Megacities combined with Fallout for parts of North America. Maybe the Megacities are insular like Nippon concerning tech but they secretly have a monopoly on some radical Technology from the Nova Wars. But the positive difference is I would have Californa be the center of the Aberrant blight, the whole of the west coast from under Alask to Mexico is tainted by Quantum. The East Coast above Florida cloistered themselves but actually have tech to back it up. Florida Alaska and the Middle states allied with vestiges of Canada, Mexico trying to handle the blight on the West while the East ignores the world. Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Guam, and Samoa become bastions of these United States of the Americas (I would have members of Central and South America Join like Panama and Trinadad and Tabago). Perhaps the Philippines, Taiwan and Hong Kong become some sort of Associate partners in Security and Trade and as it evolves maybe by the time of Aeon they join it as they haven't solved the Blight Problem and the Eastern Megacities diverged more in culture in their isolation. I would have this USAs be highly invested in Space and Antartica. And they would be rivaled by Neo America on the Moon, and Nova America in the Asteroid Belt. There would be a state on Mars that didn't go independent called New Amsterdam centered around a colony of USAs turned state. By the time of Aeon their are independent states scattered in the mid west with varying levels of isolation and potential for unification. Like I would have the Peninsula's of Michigan be Isolated with strange blight Animals migrating from the Blighted west but taking root in the cold environment.<br /> <br /> And I would move the Cyberpunk setting space, so maybe the Moon or Mars, or a cluster of O'Neil Cylinders. Since they would be built using Megacash levels of funds I could see one being a fit example of a Corporate HQ.<br /> <br /> And the Nation of Sealand is still a Thing. It would be tiny but I could see it even having a sister locale as a spacestation.<br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Ohh maybe California was separated from the Continent, Escape from LA style. During the Nova War it became Quantum Taint central and some well meaning Mad Scientists and Super Strong types amplified the Blight in their fight but cracked the fault and drifted the west coast into the pacific but still close by, probably the new coasts could see each other with the naked eye. So the new Island/subcontinent is where the concentrated Quantum Taint is, but a great deal of Tainted land spread North South and Central, with Fauna migrating as far North as Alaska and the Amazon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","user":"Eldagusto","date":".  Added Island idea 02-17-2020, 11:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T22:44:33-08:00","id":1368687,"title":"","content":"Personally, I like the overall setup on the \u00c6on-era Earth; it's just some details I would change. Consider this an endorsement if <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar353_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"353\" data-vbnamecard=\"353\">Blaque</a>'s observations; those are the sorts of issues that would need to be addressed. <br /> <br /> As for just blowing up the Earth and focusing only on space: too soon. With the technology and industry available in the 22nd century, humanity <i>still</i> doesn't have the capacity for a mass exodus from Earth: I'd say that 90% or so of the people on Earth are stuck there. Under those conditions, taking Earth completely out of the picture would decimate the human race. Give it another century or two, and things will be different \u2014 but even then, the spread of the bulk of humanity into space would result in Earth's cultures and politics coming with them. You might end up with something akin to Battletech's Successor States; but what you likely <i>wouldn't</i> end up with would be an Empire of Man ruling over a uniculture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 02-18-2020, 03:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-18T00:03:36-08:00","id":1368693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368609#post1368609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But that's the point Japan is derived from Nippon, its the attempt to capture another language's name in a time before recordings. With recordings its easier to establish fidelity if they can anchor it to the public memory, but language drift is pretty inevitable and Japan's \u65e5\u672c will be different from a different language's Nippon. My personal experience if you speak a word in Japanese (and Mandarin and Cantonese) and don't emulate the languages accent rather then using an American accent it can easily fly over their head unless they are paying close attention to the conversation and understand the context of the word you butchered in pronunciation.<br /> <br /> So basically all I'm saying is Japan and Nippon would pretty much the same because people are going to mispronounce Nippon looping back to the Creation of the word Japan in the first place.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is again, literally whan Iran went through in the 1930s and what India and Ukraine have been doing in the last 20 years with the renaming of many of its cities. Japan going by Nippon is just kind of &quot;resetting the drift&quot; more or less. Just like Persia deciding that since Farsi isn't like, the only ethnic group that matters and not what they actually call themselves, decided to reset their name from what it had been called for over two millennia. And it is what Eswatini did <i>last year</i> after being Swaziland since the 19th Century. They still call themslves Eswatini in thier language and had since then. It's just now they want folks ot actually call them seomthing closer to what they like, see themselves as.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-21T12:00:29-08:00","id":1369419,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368632#post1368632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure which of the two threads this goes in - But I honestly think a fan reimagining of the national setup of Aeon Earth might be fun and useful. I say this because, as I have commented before, I just don't really care for how its set up in canon, in either edition (and Aberrant as well, but thats not thefocus here), and think coming up with alternate ideas might be fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then be that fan. For my part I plan to use the setting pretty much as is. Figure probably very little of my game will involve the FSA and I doubt my group will see Persia as anything other than a name on a map. Granted that those plans might change once <i>Terra Firma</i> comes out. If I see something cool in Persia I might well set something there. Though if I do, I'll probably just call the place Iran.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-21T17:27:05-08:00","id":1369475,"title":"","content":"Back to the theme of things they need to clear up in an Atlas of Aeon Era Earth. Southeast Asia and Indonesia are incredibly diverse cultures and fasinating too. Although it's highly romantic, long out of date, and written by two English men who wanted to wander off into the Arabian Nights, Ring of Fire actually is a good introduction to just how diverse and complex Indonesia is. And Indonesia is only one nation among many in the region!<br /> <br /> One historical theme that will need covered is the fallout of China's immense power in this setting on the lives of the Chinese ethnic minorities in this region. Historically, when China is strong and agressive, as in this setting, local Chinese ethnic minorities fall victim to the paranoia of their neighbors. The cycles if repression often get compared to antisemitism in the West.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 02-22-2020, 07:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T05:50:30-08:00","id":1369821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368268#post1368268\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even in the early two thousands I've known people that would have patted considered these [LEFT][COLOR=#252C2F][FONT=inherit]\u2018pat yourself on the back political point\u2019 settings, not at all limiting it to modern day.</div> </div> </div> </div>By the middle of Obama's second term, the left had stated turning against him, esp. on immigration. His rhetoric about it would be called fascist today.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2893-muon","name":"muon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T11:56:30-08:00","id":1369888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1368437#post1368437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean I'm poor in the US now and I don't have voting restrictions or threat of being sent to a concentration camp... so it does sound different from now...</div> </div> </div> </div>At the moment. You don't face that right now. There are people in the USA who would love to implement that kind of voting restriction. There always have been, and all it would take to kick them into power is enough powerful people being scared enough to put effort into getting them into a position to implement that sort of policy. None of it is even slightly unbelievable. Star Trek even did it in the 90s.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_Tense_(Star_Trek:_Deep_Space_Nine\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_T...eep_Space_Nine</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T13:07:36-08:00","id":1369898,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't use a sci-fi show as a reference for believability.<br /> <br /> That said, the smarter play by would-be tyrants wouldn't be to take away the vote. It would be to keep the vote to help keep the people pacified (because they're less likely to revolt if they feel like they have a say in the political process), but to manage it by establishing full (though probably covert) control over who can run, and by severely limiting the power of elected offices and moving all of the <i>real</i> decision-making power out of the hands of the elected officials and into the hands of a largely behind the scenes bureaucracy that's directly answerable only to said would-be tyrant. That is, arrange for a takeover of the government in a way that the public doesn't realize that they've been shut out: let them have the illusion that they have a voice in the government. <br /> <br /> Basically, a brutal police state strikes me as more likely as a \u201cPlan B\u201d, to be implemented if something happens to disrupt the aforementioned \u201cPlan A\u201d. Something like someone from the outside getting elected before our would-be tyrant has locked down his control over who can run, who starts reclaiming power from the bureaucracy that's implicitly but not explicitly been handed over to them, and who starts putting people into the bureaucracy who share his agenda of dismantling the \u201cshadow government\u201d aspects of it and feel no loyalty to the would-be tyrants. <br /> <br /> If something like that were to happen, the would-be tyrants might panic and decide that more overt actions need to be taken. Even then, I figure they'd start by trying to get their \u201cshadow government\u201d plan back on track by doing whatever it takes to resist and ultimately oust the disruptor to minimize the damage he does, then set to work on repairing the damage and putting in additional safeguards to make sure it never happens again. If all of that fails (say, if the resistance isn't effective and the attempt to oust the disruptor fails), <i>then</i> getting people scared and playing on their fear to establish a more overtly tyrannical government would be a way to go.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-23T16:38:13-08:00","id":1369925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1369888#post1369888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At the moment. You don't face that right now. There are people in the USA who would love to implement that kind of voting restriction. There always have been, and all it would take to kick them into power is enough powerful people being scared enough to put effort into getting them into a position to implement that sort of policy. None of it is even slightly unbelievable. Star Trek even did it in the 90s.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_Tense_(Star_Trek:_Deep_Space_Nine\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Past_T...eep_Space_Nine</a>)</div> </div> </div> </div>Present day Russia has elections. But the government decides who may run and Putin owns or controls all news outlets, or nearly all. The opposition has little chance. You cite Deep Space Nine, let me cite V in V for Vendetta. &quot;It's unwise of them to take the people's rights away. It makes it harder to delude them (the people of Britain) into thinking they're in control.&quot;<br /> <br /> The FSA is Stoopid Evul! It is grossly unrealistic. Yes, America could fall to a right wing junta ( and some people sound like they wish for that when they claim to warn us). However, the FSA isn't believable. And it isn't even labeled correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T00:27:46-08:00","id":1369992,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1369925#post1369925\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Present day Russia has elections. But the government decides who may run and Putin owns or controls all news outlets, or nearly all. The opposition has little chance. You cite Deep Space Nine, let me cite V in V for Vendetta. &quot;It's unwise of them to take the people's rights away. It makes it harder to delude them (the people of Britain) into thinking they're in control.&quot;<br /> <br /> The FSA is Stoopid Evul! It is grossly unrealistic. Yes, America could fall to a right wing junta ( and some people sound like they wish for that when they claim to warn us). However, the FSA isn't believable. And it isn't even labeled correctly.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's ultimately my problem with it... It seems lazy. Something like Judge Dredd/Wakanda style Isolationists or a complete Fallout Style Wasteland with hidden cities would have been more interesting. And the rest of the world just twiddles there thumbs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T03:19:57-08:00","id":1370020,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1369992#post1369992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's ultimately my problem with it... It seems lazy. Something like Judge Dredd/Wakanda style Isolationists or a complete Fallout Style Wasteland with hidden cities would have been more interesting. And the rest of the world just twiddles there thumbs?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. You\u2019ve been here long enough to know that you can disagree with the creative decisions of the devs, but you don\u2019t get to insult people who work very hard with terms like \u201clazy\u201d. Dial it back, please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T09:02:26-08:00","id":1370065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1370020#post1370020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope. You\u2019ve been here long enough to know that you can disagree with the creative decisions of the devs, but you don\u2019t get to insult people who work very hard with terms like \u201clazy\u201d. Dial it back, please.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am sorry if this thread has caused any pain or if I have opened he door to impropriety, I take full blame for anything on this thread that is offensive. I meant to gain some changes in the Setting Atlas for Earth. Please, chalk down anything Eldagusto (who is a good and lively contributor to these forums) said that offended, to my bad influence and hold nothing against him.<br /> <br /> Although I think I am right to criticize the setting, I always hoped to stay within the bounds of civility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-24T11:46:33-08:00","id":1370108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1370065#post1370065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I am sorry if this thread has caused any pain or if I have opened he door to impropriety, I take full blame for anything on this thread that is offensive. I meant to gain some changes in the Setting Atlas for Earth. Please, chalk down anything Eldagusto (who is a good and lively contributor to these forums) said that offended, to my bad influence and hold nothing against him.<br /> <br /> Although I think I am right to criticize the setting, I always hoped to stay within the bounds of civility.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> OK, I appreciate the thought, but the forum here doesn\u2019t work that way, though. If you post, and you cross over any forum lines, that\u2019s on you. Or in this case, not on you, but on Eldagusto. You clearly have issues with the setting as presented, you\u2019ve stated those issues and discussion has ensued. Which is pretty much the purpose of these forums, so that\u2019s good. If you impugned the creators while that happened, I didn\u2019t catch that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-29T11:05:21-08:00","id":1371997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1370065#post1370065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I am sorry if this thread has caused any pain or if I have opened he door to impropriety, I take full blame for anything on this thread that is offensive. I meant to gain some changes in the Setting Atlas for Earth. Please, chalk down anything Eldagusto (who is a good and lively contributor to these forums) said that offended, to my bad influence and hold nothing against him.<br /> <br /> Although I think I am right to criticize the setting, I always hoped to stay within the bounds of civility.</div> </div> </div> </div>I take full responsibility for my posts, your a good one Astro, and I mean that whole heartedly that was noble of you to try to take responsibility, but what I say is what I say.<br /> <br /> We've been riled up in a discussion. I apologize if what I said was disrespectful.<br /> <br /> I would like to point out I am an unabashed and prolific advocate for Onyxpath, side effect is I give some honest hot takes because I feel when praise is more significant when they know you also point out criticisms. I'll tone it down, but honestly the biggest effect it will have is I will feel less inclined to comment my opinion in general, and that over means I'm just not talking or engaging the products, and the vast majority of it was honest praise and support.<br /> <br /> I've supported creator decisions or played devils advocate for a lot of products since this was just the whitewolf forums, like I recall deflecting a lot of hot hate that Manual of Exalted Powers Infernals, Dreams of the First Age, and Manual of Exalted Powers Abyssals received. And advocating for the both Mage titles when their was apparently a big divide between Awakening and Ascension fans. I do remember getting scolded by Rich ages ago for my perceived casting of aspersions on Scion 1st ed.<br /> <br /> Now I will reframe from criticizing because its seems unclear to me now what will cross the line. Like I have some criticisms about perceived weakness Onyxpath has towards Sci Fi as opposed to their strengths in Fantasy and Gritty stuff. I never got around to doing it but I don't know if honest criticism can delivered without clapback. Seriously I don't know if I am free to criticize works here now, outside of some real spin doctoring apologia in the forms of something like a pros and con review. I don't want to insult people, but I don't want to be a sycophant. I want to be honest, and if apologize if it seems I get heated.<br /> <br /> Just seems hollow if I'm only going to speak up with my praise. I mean honestly Trinity and Changeling have really succeeded in getting me hyped for the future, and Exalted has always been slow and steady, while at the same time most people are unfamiliar with these corners of the RPG library. But I do have criticism about them. But I guess the answer for now is to cloister myself off from regular discussion. It seems though when I leave for a month or two and come back I see more and more Bans on random posters. I mean if the solution is to disengage it just dies for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T03:13:16-08:00","id":1372413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1369992#post1369992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's ultimately my problem with it... It seems lazy. Something like Judge Dredd/Wakanda style Isolationists or a complete Fallout Style Wasteland with hidden cities would have been more interesting. And the rest of the world just twiddles there thumbs?</div> </div> </div> </div>When the USA first became a nation, only white males who owned property were allowed to vote. The idea that only the people who pay for this country get to say how the country is run is not a new one. Back in 1896 a cabal of the wealthiest men formed a conspiracy to ensure the election of William McKinley to the office of President because his policies would favor them.<br /> <br /> The &quot;American Dream&quot; has a &quot;nightmare&quot; corollary. Sure, if you're smart enough, determined enough and work hard enough, you too can achieve great success. So if you don't achieve great success that must mean that your just too stupid, weak-willed or lazy. So being poor is your own fault.<br /> <br /> Right here, right now, in the real world in which we live, there's a decent chance that the American Presidential race will be between billionaire Donald Trump and billionaire Michael Bloomberg (who hass yet to win a single delegate and is thus far just buying his way into the race).<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, we already have a Fallout setting in Europe and isolationism is somewhat covered by Nippon. We don't need more of that. Asshole corporate fascism is better covered by the warped USA in the FSA.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-03T05:54:38-08:00","id":1372434,"title":"","content":"All nations have dark sides and brutal sins in their collective past. Only the United States of America is considered invalid as a nation for this. This makes the routine use of the USA as a dystopia problematic in the same way recycling the old anti-Semitic stereotypes when drawling Uncle Sam or bankers is. By the way, did you know that anti-American protests in Europe routinely reuse Nazi era anti Jewish coreography and imagry when attacking US policy. They do. They are aware they do, and they are proud that they do. <br /> <br /> This RPG isn't in a vacuum. <br /> <br /> I object to an incorrect use of the term fascist. And I find evil without origin or function highly problematic. The other villains in the piece are given motives. They get understandable, if wrong, reasons to act. Surely the FSA can be labeled a plutocratic oligrachy and given some coherent reasons for being paranoid in their foreign policy.<br /> <br /> Let me make clear, I'm criticizing an artistic choice I disagree with. I make no accusations of bigotry or malice. I simply find an artistic choice in the composition of this game setting bad. I also recognize that since these game settings are vetted by a group, the author may have been unwillingly forced into a bad artistic choice. So I am unhappy/angry about what I see as a bad choice artistically, I do not see blame as a relevant catagory. I seek change not blaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 03-03-2020, 03:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T13:23:16-07:00","id":1373601,"title":"","content":"Some should also take into account that 60 years is not forever and tales of previous better times would be passed down among families living in the FSA. From what I have seen in the Write up, while the FSA is described as 'fascist', it does not match the definitional version of 'Fascism'. It's more totalitarian definitely, but any aspiring dictator needs to keep the populace at least reasonably happy (see China) or face rebellion. And given the USA is the land of firearms. Yeah weapons manufacturing is not that hard with the kinda tech left behind after the Abberant War<br /> <br /> But I digress, The Maps do need a bit of work because a more thought-out version of Earth does need to be done. Perhaps a later Terran Sourcebook would be in order","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-08T15:56:09-07:00","id":1373626,"title":"","content":"I have to agree, FSA is not Facist, it\u2019s Plutocrat. The rich become the nobility, and instead of nobility titles they have companies. It\u2019s just not democratic, it\u2019s not facist.<br /> <br /> FSA is described as pacific most of times and most of places, and, as I said before, it\u2019s probable that most people don\u2019t really notice the difference between USA and FSA (except for the lack of political power). People will work, interact with others and pay taxes as usual, it\u2019s not illegal to be a second class citizen, if you extrapolate, many people right now choose to be second class citizens by not voting and not participating in the political life in their communities.<br /> <br /> I would even say the right to vote related to payed taxes would apply to State and National levels, while in municipality it would be about the same, as most cities don\u2019t have that many rich people. Also, there would be people forming cooperatives to, as a team, chose one among them to be a first class citizen and represent them on municipality level, or even higher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T05:28:48-07:00","id":1373741,"title":"","content":"Well in the actual write-up the FSA &quot;fascist&quot; is never described as fascist only on page 18 when there is the description how to use the FSA thematically.<br /> <br /> Of course it is not 20th century fascism.<br /> Maybe fascistic-plutocratic totalitarian state might be more accurate.<br /> <br /> What is fascisitc in the FSA:<br /> - actual use of othering and racism as politcal and propagandic tool inside and outside of the FSA.<br /> - just the mentioning that you might be part of a abberant cult or even one - might get you deported and killed.<br /> - law is casually stretched and broken by police /military without repurcussions.<br /> - imperlialistic expansion into mexico and canada. propagandacally motivated as a need to keep the people fed. This is &quot;Lebensraum im Osten&quot; ideology transported into the 22nd century.<br /> - corporations have almost free reign as long the FSA and the Military don\u00b4t feel treatend and they keep the production up. This was very similiar in germany back then.<br /> - using class and alienation as propagandic tools.<br /> - different kind of citizenships - using minority group as boogeymen or actual conspiracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T08:03:04-07:00","id":1373759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maekkel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1373741#post1373741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1- actual use of othering and racism as politcal and propagandic tool inside and outside of the FSA.<br /> 2- just the mentioning that you might be part of a abberant cult or even one - might get you deported and killed.<br /> 3- law is casually stretched and broken by police /military without repurcussions.<br /> 4- imperlialistic expansion into mexico and canada. propagandacally motivated as a need to keep the people fed. This is &quot;Lebensraum im Osten&quot; ideology transported into the 22nd century.<br /> 5- corporations have almost free reign as long the FSA and the Military don\u00b4t feel treatend and they keep the production up. This was very similiar in germany back then.<br /> 6- using class and alienation as propagandic tools.<br /> 7- different kind of citizenships - using minority group as boogeymen or actual conspiracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>From Wikipedia &quot;<b>Fascism</b><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" target=\"_blank\">/\u02c8f\u00e6\u0283\u026az\u0259m/</a></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">) is a form of </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Far-right\" target=\"_blank\">far-right</a><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Authoritarian\" target=\"_blank\">authoritarian</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ultranationalism\" target=\"_blank\">ultranationalism</a><sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fascism#cite_note-authoritarian-and-authoritarianism-1\" target=\"_blank\">[1]</a></sup><sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fascism#cite_note-2\" target=\"_blank\">[2]</a></sup><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> characterized by dictatorial power, forcible suppression of opposition, and strong regimentation of society and of the economy</span></span></span><sup><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fascism#cite_note-3\" target=\"_blank\">[3]</a></sup><span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> which came to prominence in early 20th-century Europe.&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Just as a matter make it easer to address, I numbered your points.<br /> <br /> 1- They are not more racist than modern USA. The Prexy is African-American, and as they turn Mexico as part of their country, the local population must have become citizens (second class for most, and first class for the riches). So, while they are racist, it's not legal to be racist.<br /> 2- True, but much connected to 3<br /> 3- True, but not necessarily facist, it works like that whenever you have a totalitarian regimen, for example nobles are subject to different rules than peasants, in any dictatorship you have more power in the hands of police/military than it should be.<br /> 4- True, but not necessarily facist, other countries did it while not being facist (pointing to most of European countries), and even USA did it to Mexico a few hundred years back.<br /> 5- That is Plutocracy, not really facist, yet it can happen on facist regimen. Nazi Germany didn't gave power to the companies, they gave power to the members of the party (that owns companies), so the powers were not in the hands of the Companies but in the hands of the Party Members, a rich company owned by people that were not part of the Party were in a bad situation. In FSA, the power is in the hand of ALL rich, and the richer you are more political power you have, for example Orgotek is unreachable by other companies because they pay a lot of taxes, even if they work against the government totalitarian system.<br /> 6- That is the most facist part.<br /> 7- That is more common than you think (the boogy-man part is on 6, not really here). Nobles and Military are under different legal system in most of countries, including USA (of course for military crimes only, including crimes involving only military people), it is more like a signal of weak democracy than facist in most cases. Facist classes usually is based on pedigree and not on owning, for example if you are White you are first class, if you are Jew or Immigrant you are second, a second class people will never have the chance of becoming first class. In FSA, you pay to be a different class, you are not born this way (while if you were born rich you have a better chance of continue rich), a rich African that moves to FSA will become a first class citizen, while a poor american will be second class for as long he is poor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T14:03:23-07:00","id":1373811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maekkel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1373741#post1373741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well in the actual write-up the FSA fascist is never described as fascist only on page 18 when there is the description how to use the FSA thematically.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a key point that this thread seems to overlook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-09T17:28:37-07:00","id":1373820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1347081-what-they-need-to-clear-up-when-they-do-a-world-atlas-problems-with-aeon-s-earth?p=1